  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kebbi - Dawanau Group Farmers Cooperative Association</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Groundnut Beneficiaries: 200 (112 women) Description: DGFCA is seeking funding to provide the necessary support to the cooperative in terms of fixed assets procurement, equipment, liquidity and other materials required for an enhancement of the cooperatives scope of activities and increased productivity, revenue and impact. The funding anticipated from USADF would enable the members of DGFCA increase their production of groundnut and groundnut oil as well as other ancillary products. The aggregate impact of this growth in output would be seen in increased groundnut oil available to the consuming public, higher level of employment, more income for the individual famers and an improvement in their standard of living. The cooperative society will also benefit from the commission that will be accruing to its coffers.</narrative>
  </description>
